{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_t007r0504_denkigroup_01",
      "hash": "524907406bf4611c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我在給女朋友買禮物。\\c\\n要是送她水之石，\\n她搞不好會進化呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t007r0504_boyscout_01",
      "hash": "b239d6a10194de76",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有些寶可夢可以\\n使用進化之石進化呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t007r0504_partner_01",
      "hash": "3893480216768e80",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……哼。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t007r0504_boyscout_02",
      "hash": "b239d5a10194dcc3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的[VAR POKNAME(0002)]似乎\\n想維持現在的姿態\\r\\n跟[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳在一起呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t007r0504_staffm_01",
      "hash": "d41778eac0d170b1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "雖然這裡沒有賣……\\c\\n聽說世界上有種叫超級石的\\n厲害石頭呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_t007r0504_kanban_01",
      "hash": "6d9f03713490430f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "４樓……把您的真心送出去吧！\\n聰明人禮品店！\\c\\n現正舉行\\n寶可夢進化石特賣會！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_t007r0504_max",
